  m_Name: Ending_Mountain
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Ending
  endingTitle: Mountain
  titleDA: Livet i bjergene
  descriptionDA: "K\xE6mpepandaen er h\xF8jt oppe i bjergene! \n\nHer er stille og
    fredeligt, men der er ikke meget bambus. Det kr\xE6ver masser af energi at finde
    mad nok! \n\nPandaer flytter ofte op i bjergene om sommeren for at holde sig
    k\xF8lige og ned i dalen om vinteren for at finde mere mad.\n\nN\xE5r du bes\xF8ger
    zoologisk have, st\xF8tter du et avlsprogram, der er med til at beskytte k\xE6mpepandaer!
    \nOg n\xE5r du k\xF8ber bambusprodukter, s\xE5 kig efter FSC-m\xE6rket. Det hj\xE6lper
    dig med at v\xE6lge produkter, der er lavet med omtanke for skovene og dyrelivet.  "
  titleEN: "Life in the Mountains\_"
  descriptionEN: "The giant panda stays high in the mountains! \n\nIt's quiet and
    peaceful, but there's not much bamboo. Finding enough food takes a lot of energy!
    \n\nPandas often move up the mountains in summer to stay cool, and down to the
    valley in winter to find more food. \n\nWhen you visit the zoo, you support a
    breeding program that helps protect giant pandas! \nAnd when you buy bamboo products,
    look for the FSC label. It helps you choose products made with care for forests
    and wildlife.  "
  endingImage: {fileID: 0}
